HasForbiddenModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Target-independence predicate: returns 1 if the op string contains target-specific tokens (i32/i64/f32/f64/wasm/register/stack), else 0. Signals wasm-specific leakage into IR.
    Provides: HasForbidden(op) -> bad.
    DependsOn: none (leaf in module dependencies)
    Composition: Native Include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../HasForbidden/HasForbidden.sir).
